# v0.23.0 — Design & Correctness Audit (overview)

**Scope**: all subdirectories, focused on defects and design gaps rather than style.
**Baseline**: `main` at `d6b6b9dda` (v0.22 remediation merged, PR #91).
**Date**: 2026-08-09.

